# Oblivious Bookworm: "If you do, discard a card" follows a card actually drawn (CR 608.2c). Bot1's deck is its opening
# hand, so its library is empty when it accepts the turn-1 end-step draw: nothing is drawn, nothing is discarded (four
# Islands stay in hand), and having tried to draw from an empty library Bot1 loses the game (CR 704.5b).

[Bot1 Deck]
Mox Emerald
Mox Sapphire
Oblivious Bookworm
Island x4

[Bot2 Deck]
Swamp x20

[Actions]
Bot1.Hand.Mox Emerald.Cast
Bot1.Hand.Mox Sapphire.Cast
Bot1.Battlefield.Mox Emerald.Activate
Bot1.Battlefield.Mox Sapphire.Activate
Bot1.Hand.Oblivious Bookworm.Cast
[T1 Bot1.End]
Bot1.Accept

[Expect]
Result = Bot2 won
Bot1.Hand.Count = 4
Bot1.Graveyard.Count = 0
